      en: "The Rhumerie de Chamarel is one of the most beautiful and modern rum distilleries in Mauritius, located in the southwest mountains at an altitude of 300 meters above sea level. The distillery's specialty is its use of fresh sugarcane juice from its own plantations (the 'Agricultural Rum' method), as opposed to mass-produced molasses-based rums. The elegant style of the building and the surrounding sugarcane fields provide a stunning experience. Visitors can take guided tours to see the copper stills and the aging cellars where the spirits mature in oak barrels. The Rhumerie is committed to sustainability, using production waste for energy and fertilization. The rums produced here are ambassadors of Mauritian quality to the world. History K8 — Agricultural Processing Industry and Modernization."
