      en: "Mauritius Horse Trails is a renowned equestrian center in the north of the island that offers a unique experience: horseback riding on white sandy beaches and through tropical forests. A special feature of the center is that many of its horses are rescued animals, adopted from the local horse racing industry after retirement and retrained for leisure riding. Tours take visitors through the most beautiful landscapes around Mon Choisy and Grand Baie, providing the opportunity to enter the shallow, turquoise waters with the horses. Horseback riding is not just a sport but a therapeutic experience that brings people closer to nature. The center welcomes riders of all levels, from beginners to professionals. Nature Science K5 — The Relationship Between Humans and Animals."
